git basic commands:
git init - to initialze a git repository
git status - to check status of the repository
git add . - to add your files to repository 
git config --global user.name  - to set Author identity
git config --global user.email - identity
git commit -m "Example-program" - to commit files to repository
git rm --cached directory - to remove file from the repository
git push -u origin main - to push your file to the gitHub
